OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreaks in    
OL,6,Fthe cloud will allow temperatures to   
OL,7,Ffall and a patchy frost to form        
OL,8,Ftowards dawn. It will gradually become 
OL,9,Fcloudier towards the west however,     
OL,10,Fwith patchy light rain possible here   
OL,11,Fby the morning. Feeling chilly with    
OL,12,Flight winds.                           
OL,14,CTuesday:FCloudy, with patchy rain at   
OL,15,Ffirst in the west. Cloud will break in 
OL,16,Fthe east during the afternoon with     
OL,17,Fsunny spells, but becoming cloudy      
OL,18,Fagain overnight. Turning increasingly  
OL,19,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
