OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fand mostly dry through the period,     
OL,7,Fwith some isolated showers on          
OL,8,FThursday. Winds easing but feeling     
OL,9,Fcool with temperatures slightly below  
OL,10,Faverage.                               
